msgid "# Doc writing guide"
msgstr "# 文档编写指南"

msgid "## Guide to Writing Model Tutorial Doc"
msgstr "## 编写模型教程文档指南"

msgid ""
"`docs/source/_templates/Model-Deployment-Tutorial-Template.md` is a template"
" for writing model deployment tutorials. You can copy and modify it to "
"create new docs."
msgstr ""
"`docs/source/_templates/Model-Deployment-Tutorial-Template.md` "
"是编写模型部署教程的模板。您可以复制并修改它以创建新文档。"

msgid "## Fullscreen tables"
msgstr "## 全屏表格"

msgid ""
"Horizontally overflowing tables have a fullscreen action. In fullscreen view,\n"
"the table header (`<thead>`, generated by Markdown tables) stays visible during\n"
"vertical scrolling, and the first column stays visible during horizontal\n"
"scrolling. A table without `<thead>` does not freeze its first row. First-column\n"
"cells spanning multiple rows are supported, including `rowspan=\"0\"`, which\n"
"extends to the end of the row group."
msgstr ""
"水平方向溢出的表格具有全屏操作。在全屏视图中，表头（`<thead>`，由 Markdown "
"表格生成）在垂直滚动时保持可见，第一列在水平滚动时保持可见。没有 `<thead>` 的表格不会冻结其第一行。支持跨多行的第一列单元格，包括 "
"`rowspan=\"0\"`，它会延伸到行组的末尾。"

msgid ""
"If a table's first column does not provide useful context, disable its horizontal\n"
"freezing with `data-table-sticky-column=\"false\"`. For a Markdown table, place it\n"
"inside a wrapper as shown below. The existing `md_in_html` extension renders the\n"
"Markdown inside `markdown=\"1\"` wrappers."
msgstr ""
"如果表格的第一列无法提供有用的上下文，可以使用 `data-table-sticky-column=\"false\"` 禁用其水平冻结。对于 "
"Markdown 表格，请将其放在如下所示的包装器中。现有的 `md_in_html` 扩展会渲染 `markdown=\"1\"` 包装器内的 "
"Markdown。"

msgid ""
"For an HTML table, add the attribute directly to `<table>`. This setting affects\n"
"only first-column freezing in fullscreen view; header freezing and normal\n"
"document layout retain their existing behavior."
msgstr "对于 HTML 表格，请直接将属性添加到 `<table>`。此设置仅影响全屏视图中的第一列冻结；表头冻结和常规文档布局保持其现有行为。"

msgid "## Guide to Writing Triton Operator Docs"
msgstr "## Triton 算子文档编写指南"

msgid ""
"New Triton implementations belong under\n"
"`vllm_ascend/ops/triton/`, with their operator documents under\n"
"`vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/`. The `v2/` namespace is retired by the operator\n"
"layout refactor."
msgstr ""
"新的 Triton 实现应放在\n"
"`vllm_ascend/ops/triton/` 下，其算子文档应放在\n"
"`vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/` 下。经过算子\n"
"布局重构后，`v2/` 命名空间已废弃。"

msgid ""
"Use the [operator documentation template](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/triton_description_specification.md)\n"
"for the placement rules and the operator inventory before adding or moving an\n"
"operator document."
msgstr ""
"在添加或移动算子文档之前，请使用[算子文档模板](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/vllm_ascend/ops/triton/docs/triton_description_specification.md)\n"
"了解放置规则和算子清单。"

msgid "## Preview your changes"
msgstr "## 预览您的更改"

msgid "Use standard fenced code blocks for commands and code examples."
msgstr "命令和代码示例请使用标准的围栏代码块。"

msgid ""
"Follow the [documentation build instructions](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/docs/README.md) to preview the English and "
"Chinese sites locally."
msgstr ""
"请按照[文档构建说明](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/docs/README.md)在本地预览英文和中文站点。"

msgid "## Multi-row table headers"
msgstr "## 多行表头"

msgid ""
"Use the `pymdown_multimd_table` Markdown extension for grouped table headers\n"
"instead of writing an HTML table. Put every header row before the separator:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `pymdown_multimd_table` Markdown 扩展来实现分组表头，而不是编写 HTML 表格。将所有表头行放在分隔行之前："

msgid ""
"Consecutive pipes (`||`) extend the preceding cell across columns. A `^^` cell\n"
"merges with the cell above it, including in the header. Use a space (`| |`) for\n"
"an ordinary empty cell; removing that space changes the table's structure.\n"
"Inside a content tab, indent every table row by four spaces. These extensions\n"
"render on the documentation site, but GitHub's Markdown preview does not support\n"
"the merged cells."
msgstr ""
"连续的竖线（`||`）会将前一个单元格跨列延伸。`^^` 单元格会与其上方的单元格合并，包括在表头中。使用空格（`| "
"|`）表示普通的空单元格；去掉该空格会改变表格结构。在内容标签页中，将每个表格行缩进四个空格。这些扩展在文档站点上可以正常渲染，但 GitHub 的 "
"Markdown 预览不支持合并单元格。"

msgid ""
"The translation extractor keeps all header rows together as one PO entry and\n"
"omits data-only rows. Preserve pipes, blank cells, `^^`, and link targets in the\n"
"translation. This keeps model matrices out of long translation requests while\n"
"retaining their grouped headers."
msgstr ""
"翻译提取器会将所有表头行保留为一个 PO 条目，并省略仅包含数据的行。在翻译中请保留竖线、空单元格、`^^` "
"以及链接目标。这样既能避免将模型矩阵纳入冗长的翻译请求，又能保留其分组表头。"
